{"id":"652039","name":"月婆鸡汤米粉","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/652039/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:鸡肉。","img":"images/652039/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"姜。","img":"images/652039/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"提前泡软的米粉。","img":"images/652039/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"米酒。","img":"images/652039/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡肉改刀斩件备用。","img":"images/652039/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅放麻油，再放姜小火煸香。","img":"images/652039/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入鸡肉大火翻炒一下下。","img":"images/652039/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调适量的米酒快速翻炒一下下能去腥增香。","img":"images/652039/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"添加适量开水大火烧开。","img":"images/652039/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上盖子调中火煮15分钟。","img":"images/652039/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"同时另外起锅把米粉烫熟。","img":"images/652039/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捞出来盛入碗里。","img":"images/652039/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放点葱花。","img":"images/652039/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煮了15分钟的月婆鸡汤真的很香。","img":"images/652039/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"调点盐，加入枸杞子煮一分钟即可。","img":"images/652039/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"这汤不管配米饭，面，粉都非常不错，喝汤吃肉肉。","img":"images/652039/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"把煮好的月婆鸡汤盛入装米粉的碗里，一碗非常美味的汤米粉就完成了。","img":"images/652039/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/652039/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/652039/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}